-- ---------------------------------------------------------------- RC11's outcomes of a program
-- as for the axiomatic form of TSO (tso-ax-outcomes): each thread alone with read values from
-- a domain gives its events with their orderings; every rf and every order of each location's
-- writes; the RC11-consistent candidates give the outcomes
RcRun : Type → Type
RcRun R = Word → List TsoEv → List (Word × MOrd) → R → R
